^{:go/end 263} (go/func BenchEntry "BenchEntry makes this vCPU's SYSCALL entry the measuring one (on) or the ordinary one (off): a\nprocess's SYSCALL with RAX 1, 2 or 3 is then answered in the entry itself -- the bare crossing,\nthe crossing with the two CR3 writes as built, the same with the process's TLB entries flushed\n-- and any other as always (doc/go/PROCESS-SPEC.md, \"As built: KU2\", KS13). For the kernel's\nmeasurements only; UserSetup has run on this vCPU.\n" [^bool on]
